12. ANTI-CIRCUMVENTION
============================================================

The parties acknowledge that the Node Verification Mechanism may
constitute a technological authorization mechanism.

Nothing in this License is intended to predetermine whether any
particular act constitutes unlawful circumvention under 17 U.S.C.
1201 or any analogous law.

The contractual restriction in Section 6 applies independently of
whether separate statutory anti-circumvention remedies are available.

